    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>35装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>金色和紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 35</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> gold and purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每件外观均拥有基础风尚度，玩家可通过消耗染色材料，染色并保存方案获得额外风尚度加成，方案中每消耗<Highlight>1</>个珊瑚染料获得<Highlight>10</>风尚度，每消耗<Highlight>1</>个虹光染料获得<Highlight>40</>风尚度，每消耗<Highlight>1</>个泡沫染膏获得<Highlight>20</>风尚度，每消耗一个神眷牌获得<Highlight>4000</>风尚度。系统将从该外观已保存的全部染色方案中，选取额外风尚度最高的<Highlight> 3 </>套，累加至基础风尚度之上，作为该外观的最终风尚度。\n\n举例：\n某件外观装备的基础风尚度为 <Highlight>800</>，玩家已在该外观下保存了 <Highlight>4 </>套染色方案，四套方案所提供的额外风尚度分别为 <Highlight>150、280、420、360</>。\n系统将从这<Highlight> 4 </>套方案中选取额外风尚度最高的 <Highlight>3 </>套（即 420、360、280）结算，其余方案不参与计算。\n因此，该外观的染色累计加成为 420 + 360 + 280 = 1060，最终总风尚度为基础风尚度 800 与染色累计加成 1060 相加，即 1860。\n\n补充说明：\n1. 新增或修改染色方案后，系统将自动选取最高的<Highlight> 3 </>套参与结算，更新此外观的风尚度。\n2. 删除某套染色方案将同步移出结算队列，若删除的方案原本参与结算，则由剩余方案中次高者递补。\n3. 若玩家未保存任何染色方案，则该外观仅显示基础风尚度。"] = "Every cosmetic has a base Fashion Value. Players can consume dyeing materials to dye and save schemes to obtain additional Fashion Value bonuses. Each <Highlight>1</> Coral Dye consumed in a scheme grants <Highlight>10</> Fashion Value, each <Highlight>1</> Rainbow Dye grants <Highlight>40</> Fashion Value, each <Highlight>1</> Foam Dye grants <Highlight>20</> Fashion Value, and each Divine Favor Card consumed grants <Highlight>4000</> Fashion Value. The system will select the <Highlight> 3 </> schemes with the highest additional Fashion Value from all saved dyeing schemes for this cosmetic and add them to the base Fashion Value as the final Fashion Value of the cosmetic. \n\nExample: \nThe base Fashion Value of a certain cosmetic equipment is <Highlight>800</>. The player has saved <Highlight>4 </> dyeing schemes for this cosmetic, and the additional Fashion Value provided by the four schemes are <Highlight>150, 280, 420, 360</>. \nThe system will select the <Highlight> 3 </> schemes with the highest additional Fashion Value from these <Highlight> 4 </> schemes (i.e., 420, 360, 280) for settlement; the remaining schemes will not participate in the calculation. \nTherefore, the cumulative dyeing bonus for this cosmetic is 420 + 360 + 280 = 1060, and the final total Fashion Value is the base Fashion Value of 800 plus the cumulative dyeing bonus of 1060, which is 1860. \n\nSupplementary Notes: \n1. After adding or modifying a dyeing scheme, the system will automatically select the highest <Highlight> 3 </> schemes to participate in the settlement and update the Fashion Value of this cosmetic. \n2. Deleting a dyeing scheme will simultaneously remove it from the settlement queue. If the deleted scheme was originally participating in the settlement, it will be replaced by the next highest remaining scheme. \n3. If the player has not saved any dyeing schemes, the cosmetic will only display the base Fashion Value.",
